1
00:00:00,770 --> 00:00:03,070
- Okay, my turn. Let me talk to him.
- Go ahead.

2
00:00:03,239 --> 00:00:05,269
(Sheldon:)2311 North Los Robles Avenue...

3
00:00:05,441 --> 00:00:08,271
(Sheldon:)...Pasadena, California
to International Space Station.

4
00:00:08,444 --> 00:00:09,464
(Sheldon:)Can you read me? Over.

5
00:00:12,148 --> 00:00:14,078
(Howard:)Yes, I read you, Sheldon.

6
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:15,270
(Sheldon:)Copy that. Over.

7
00:00:17,153 --> 00:00:19,853
- What are you doing?
- I'm talking to a man in space.

8
00:00:20,056 --> 00:00:21,076
(Sheldon:)If you don't have the...

9
00:00:22,458 --> 00:00:24,928
