11
00:00:27,363 --> 00:00:29,593
(Sheldon:)That's a negative.
My mother had me tested. Over.

12
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,330
Come on, scrub-a-dub, Loops.

13
00:00:34,804 --> 00:00:37,134
(Howard:)All right. All right. I gotta go.

14
00:00:37,306 --> 00:00:39,966
(Howard:)There's a meteor shower.

15
00:00:40,142 --> 00:00:41,542
Wanna see a meteor shower?

16
00:00:41,711 --> 00:00:44,581
(Mike:)Take a look at what Dimitri
just left you in the toilet.

17
00:00:49,685 --> 00:00:51,715
- Bye.
- Over and out.

18
00:00:53,522 --> 00:00:54,852
(Raj:)Bye, buddy!

